    "detailed_description": "Dive into Box Wrangler, a thrilling multiplayer roguelike where every game is a fresh challenge! Earn temporary XP to level up during each match while collecting coins to boost your skills for future battles. Harness the power of an array of weapons and enhancements, reaching ridiculous levels of power.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpgrade your abilities with collected coins, including:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Bullet explosion chance<br />\r\n    Health boosts<br />\r\n    Increased coin value<br />\r\n    Enhanced damage<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAchieve 500 kills to escape the first level and earn 50% more coins. Join the adventure, power up, and become the ultimate Box Wrangler!",
